			"updated": 1739907175909,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 1,
			"text": "I plan to evolve my Daily Note first approach into a Topic First \nsetup in Obsidian. I will keep the Daily Note first approach for my \nwork/meeting notes, but handle everything else in a Topic First way.\nI will also give Zettelkasten another try, feeding it from my new \nDaily Note first / Topic First hybrid.",
			"textAlign": "right",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": "SAqcTgwebm_a2rZgbR28g",
			"originalText": "I plan to evolve my Daily Note first approach into a Topic First \nsetup in Obsidian. I will keep the Daily Note first approach for my \nwork/meeting notes, but handle everything else in a Topic First way.\nI will also give Zettelkasten another try, feeding it from my new \nDaily Note first / Topic First hybrid.",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"rawText": ""
		},
